Board of Public Utilities
2416 Snyder Ave
Cheyenne, WY 82001
Dear Bradley,
Thank you againfor taking the time to meetwith us to discuss our water consumption and
billing. Thank you also for sending your letter detailing what was discussed and agreed upon on
January 9, 2025.
Please take this letter as confirmation that we agree to the following payment schedule for
metered water consumption moving forward:
1.Upon the 1992 Lease Agreement #2985 being amended and signed by all parties,
Cheyenne Frontier Days(CFD) agrees.to pay50%of all metered water consumption on
CFDleased facilities through December 31,2025.
2.Beginning January 1, 2026, CFD agrees to pay for 100% ofall metered water
consumption on CFD leased facilities.
Sincerely,
on
Tom Hirsig
President/CEO
Cheyenne Frontier Days, Inc.
